INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What are the study periods and their durations?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "score": null, "scores": [0.39565945, 0.033844035, 0.03191915], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 43, "section": "6.1 Trial Flowchart", "score": 0.33155245, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 8, "section": "Study Flowchart", "score": 0.19713514, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 27, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "score": 0.015967654, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 6089, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis\n\nThe study includes the following periods:\n\n1. Run-in Period: Optional; used when stable conventional treatment is needed before screening. Its duration depends on achieving the specified treatment-stability criteria.\n[Section 6.1 Trial Flowchart \u00b7 p.43]\n\n2. Screening Period: 4 weeks (Days -28 to -1 before randomisation).\n[Section 6.1 Trial Flowchart \u00b7 p.43]\n\n3. Double-blind Treatment Period: 12 weeks.\n[Section 6.1 Trial Flowchart \u00b7 p.43]\n\n4. Safety Follow-up Period: 3 weeks, through Day 105. For patients completing the last IMP dose, the safety follow-up visit is at Day 105 (Week 15); for patients who discontinue early, it is scheduled 35 days after the last IMP dose.\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 43, "section": "6.1 Trial Flowchart", "exactText": "The trial includes a Run-in Period (if stable conventional treatment needed), a 4-week Screening Period, a 12-week double-blind Treatment Period, and a 3-week Safety Follow-up Period to Day 105.", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999989, 689.9039829101564, 547.0799999999998, 588.5349752178487]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "exactText": "For patients completing the last dose of IMP, a Safety Follow-up Visit will be scheduled to Day 105 (Week 15). For patients not completing the trial, a Safety Follow-up Visit will be scheduled 35 days (5.8 - 6.6 half-lives of TJ301) after the last dose of IMP.", "bboxes": [[90.0, 670.7999829101562, 502.92, 660.0549752178486], [71.99999999999989, 452.78398291015634, 553.8, 412.1349752178486], [72.0, 288.6239829101562, 551.5200000000001, 247.9749752178485]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.0077076256275177, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 707.0985832251608, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.521, 0.5003, 0.4926, 0.4767, 0.4741, 0.4732, 0.4728, 0.4708, 0.4676, 0.4598, 0.4571, 0.4552, 0.454, 0.4496, 0.4489, 0.4403, 0.4343, 0.4331, 0.4325, 0.4313, 0.4299, 0.4278, 0.4273, 0.4216, 0.42, 0.4196, 0.4136, 0.4134, 0.4083, 0.4058, 0.4044, 0.404, 0.4019, 0.401, 0.3925, 0.3903, 0.3899, 0.3896, 0.3885, 0.3832, 0.3749, 0.3748, 0.374, 0.3726, 0.3717], "confidence_filter_dropped_scores": [], "confidence_filter_bm25_only_scores_normalized": [], "hybrid_search": true, "cache_hit": true, "embedding_ms": 0.0, "db_search_ms": 5651.480792090297, "hybrid_parallel_ms": 6058.492583222687, "vector_count": 45, "bm25_count": 0, "fused_count": 45, "reranker_enabled": true, "reranker_provider": "cohere", "reranker_ms": 385.15670830383897, "reranker_input_count": 45, "reranker_output_count": 6, "reranker_model