entrally, dynamically randomised in a 1:1:1 fashion to each of the three arms, namely placebo, TJ301 300 mg, or TJ301 600 mg, by validated Interactive Web Response System (IWRS). Randomisation will be stratified by prior corticosteroids treatment (yes/no) and consent to participate in PK substudy (yes/no).", "bboxes": [[72.0, 233.90398291015606, 538.44, 178.01497521784836]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 92, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "exactText": "90 patients will be centrally, dynamically, stratified randomly (by elevated ( \u22653 mg/L) CRP levels, and stable conventional treatment (prior treatment with amino salicylates, corticosteroids, and immunosuppressive drugs)) assigned to 3 groups (1:1:1) to receive 600mg TJ301 biweekly (Q2W), 300mg TJ301 Q2W or placebo Q2W. ... 90 patients will be centrally, dynamically, randomly assigned to 3 groups (1:1:1) to receive 600mg TJ301 biweekly (Q2W), 300mg TJ301 Q2W or placebo Q2W. Randomisation will be stratified by prior corticosteroids treatment (yes/no) and consent to participate in PK substudy (yes/no).", "bboxes": [[52.59044647216797, 495.76949310302734, 771.7723999023438, 121.96722412109375]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": false, "condense_ms": 0.0008749775588512421, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 926.3795828446746, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.4889, 0.4441, 0.4425, 0.4368, 0.4335, 0.43, 0.4266, 0.4211, 0.417, 0.4158, 0.4131, 0.4096, 0.4045, 0.401, 0.3981, 0.3977, 0.3948, 0.3928, 0.3926, 0.3925, 0.3907, 0.3898, 0.3886, 0.3866, 0.3854, 0.3853, 0.3848, 0.384