INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What fields should the eCRF include based on this protocol?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 75, "section": "12.2 Deviations from the Protocol", "score": 0.48947302, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 71, "section": "10.2 Electronic Case Record Form", "score": null, "scores": [0.36692992, 0.022542967], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 63, "section": "8.5.2 Collection, Recording and Reporting of Serious Adverse Events SAE Reporting by the Investigator", "score": null, "scores": [0.09073549, 0.053899154], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 58, "section": "8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events", "score": 0.026056303, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 6908, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis\n\nThe protocol explicitly specifies the following fields for each adverse event in the Adverse Event Log in each patient's e-CRF:\n\n- Adverse event\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Date of onset (time can be recorded, if applicable)\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Intensity\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Causal relationship to IMP\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Action taken to IMP\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Other action taken\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Date and time of outcome\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Outcome\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\n- Seriousness\n[Section 8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events \u00b7 p.58]\n\nFor SAE reporting, the context also identifies the Demographics, Adverse Event Log, Medical History Log, and Concomitant Medication Log as mandatory e-CRF entries for initial SAE reports and for follow-up reports when relevant changes have occurred. I don't have this information on the complete field-level specifications for those additional logs.\n[Section 8.5.2 Collection, Recording and Reporting of Serious Adverse Events SAE Reporting by the Investigator \u00b7 p.63]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 58, "section": "8.2.2 Recording of Adverse Events", "exactText": "The Investigator must record all adverse events in the Adverse Event Log provided in each patient's e-CRF with information about:\n- Adverse event\n- Date of onset (time can be recorded, if applicable)\n- Intensity\n- Causal relationship to IMP\n- Action taken to IMP\n- Other action taken\n- Date and time of outcome\n- Outcome\n- Seriousness", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000011, 188.78398291015662, 511.32, 163.25497521784894]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 63, "section": "8.5.2 Collection, Recording and Reporting of Serious Adverse Events SAE Reporting by the Investigator", "exactText": "Completion of the Demographics, Adverse Event Log, Medical History Log and Concomitant Medication Log are mandatory for initial reports and for follow-up reports if any relevant changes have been made since the initial report. Data entries must have been made in the e-CRF for the Sponsor to access the information.", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000011, 135.8639829101562, 541.0800000000002, 110.45497521784853], [72.0, 369.2639829101563, 555.6, 267.89497521784847]], "relevance": "medium"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.003916211426258087, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 605.7526250369847, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_thresh